    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d8a86ae51be87b75c6e66a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好跑到最后呢…！\n要加油咯ー、哦ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db78daa3326cb2e1ccd7afc71daace09497e978287f51a8951d7209468f33da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82836f9082d63306cdfa4767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始前就觉得\n会是场好比赛…好兴奋啊。\n今天…很期待跑步呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82d9df4f7cdb6489dc559bbc690c2fc9a7adc17e901ac78d746f2d6489cc448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee58129dd010a218c310c0bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，好…!\n还没，开始吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a1cec0d42c731b69c6dbf577f9380a550d240df0f821023ce8880daa183dba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fcea40192234bfa213ccd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为和哥哥\n一起做了很多训练…！\n我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c75b36f3cc27cbd6c768d16d6060b47cbfe71c3e5b6730257366ee3bdf85e9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8efee2deb3c79443fd3dd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能做到的…能做到的。\n嗯，没问题…\n米浴，出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b8df52565bd91124f8698b4a549cafc24ea437c7822d8d72008bca2fa8ed94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cef3fe7cf90fe61f6acb2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，已经开始了…！？\n我，我会加油的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac66a5020dc29827d651b9686f723750ea9cddfba69ed18dd89767f93bb04357",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ea6d85887d83bf36b0f957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸，呼…\n不要害怕，不要害怕…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ee7c02ece212a7629d286e55e3e9d7b44cc588e04f1a6ee359b5aa00a8c986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f55c9c61ad16b65dbfad9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛前\n果然会心跳加快呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce778e14d0de27b43e309d935edb0d2c84d82210b69fa4dbfcc7d43b166cc93a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4a540403bd19d5e0579a1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行不行，不能变得不安…！\n加油米浴，加油～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "86bae3eade96e285721446695848fd260735b326eb39c656ecce1c203cf59bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b63d1d63291746063f0b712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，有点发抖了…\n那个，哥哥…稍微一会儿…\n我可以握着你的手吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4739b1b8019e67d005137892d3941edfc1cd2657bba474c90deeff775d67b491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16878e14099473959e6c1c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，那个…\n为，为了不添麻烦\n要小心点跑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57c85fa75893118c1cc3b53b170bee38b662840d3aea21628db3bd77cf13c59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a060d5975909c9a0102cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我，不想放弃…\n虽然很害怕，很不安…\n但是必须要加油…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "190d4dbd1752fd53ff3431a9ace3d9d4ff85513e9d77cda84f141d39583242cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b020050d632b93787cc15932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经不会…逃避比赛了哦。\n因，因为哥哥\n陪在我身边…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d871a750798402697dd236a140a7b207178df6ca4e1834c2c890312b694ff7f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6492cb55bb6a67984001a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…没有时间哭泣了。\n已经到正式表演了…\n要出发了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c0da54dfddc142e98db748bca16d526c20e1ba9fab30b210fc0cb1933572bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de34c054766e1cafb17a274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abba690cd69e020768dfa5944f53eab2927cf0e6d88dbd36fca0df6498a9e7b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9676f7f5baccd67f7b5ddc5",
