    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18bd83065b90feac4a6a619b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有所改变了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ea2e7324f872ebdd697c22fb678cc00430833a49869c0f9c588736333a12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1349bf945236961685b9cc7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获胜的奖励、印在脖子上！\r\n什么的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b8919e29eb04265eec9177603009e0d7fcb5016af3190918b3c6e5d9a0e436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9f8b7896527ce8a90b528cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有所改变了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ea2e7324f872ebdd697c22fb678cc00430833a49869c0f9c588736333a12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48092f9422801791a206ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，看到了吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb23eefcaa1571e69b600a550786fadbd66cffa1bcca581b89b98a5dc2bde5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83aee7d977f2227755bb096d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴在决胜中的愿望……\r\n全都实现了哦…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c7940811e037c6c089a076fb979dd19ff9436c56d98f9e7850ec694b2d2f88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1dee94486c2f38973fab50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……也有所改变了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceee1722ad27ac3637bb9628a6f906befc7155412688b06a66619ecdff76e7ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0bff370d488233f38defc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b805ba98ac4d2ee1bffc35cdabff8b5674a60835ba99277b3de4e6a2d13872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c228f5141212d852cf031f9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也…能绽放…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd3c65429a3a28202bc09d04d812b65177754f0a3f4d9ec56aeefe8fd8d3cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb5948131a9725ae0f52fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……波旁同学，看起来很辛苦。\r\n可是，就算米浴去帮忙也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4902840eef781e1a305edb8d12b99b0a67df97543049a52bb38ff96a0349e6df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74346293fba6ffdf73249c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为缪斯……\r\n米浴也能为大家带来笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08688307f2a5dc82ecd6eae6343425a71e7ed59d50bb0d59498fd7c49c9b8ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e6667016bf13d4a69b03af4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然谜题很难……\r\n但和大家在一起的话\r\n一定没问题的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff37753430c1748ff9665658a6cc82e5d26e21f9a85eb259cf6e2035a8c92c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1c9f7b84aa284ad5b2998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……不，就算是米浴也……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98144455bf545f346bc039486659584b08971d7d51326b69052a9028990ca6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252617b23fc40cf356ccc1d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赫、赫、赫——\r\n要吸你的血了哦~……！\r\n欸嘿嘿，这样还是有点太恐怖了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5972edf6382a1ba999a70ebd01ce2864c4b9a5d0a085196742e2f4428eda221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4acc0a5a4ddb27684dcbc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发誓…和最喜欢的人一起…幸福的蓝蔷薇。\n…米浴…也要绽放给你看…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a825cd4cd47d94b06339ce9769f859761d00582628c90c0b87769f9e6854a36d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29546905bd79cd4ed24bb533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴……做到了……\r\n成为了让大家露出笑容的缪斯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f25f79001389275944a66a7feea2835e49b9070fa07ee086145eb90d01734937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c88aa50b98ae043e86b975c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是有活动任务呢。\r\n一起加油吧，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6bd0ddecd9b4a4bdf59c581da484ad14886673bc3372e20e7519ecf417ee1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81a5f32c1bf784ab624e02d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "报酬，都收到了吗……？\r\n可以的话……要和米浴一起确认一下\r\n有没有忘记的东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "886fb4b81c9b1eb76bf6399ce9f2da0f70c5a11db9ae5145c16d1b1540c13830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad674e3f0b7c767f82e41d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了。\r\n那个，那个……万圣节快乐……！\r\n欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56075494d784ad454111060594e07a80fe236b49b530e884933bf6af5507d1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d76c4354be58e8e42794ea3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝙蝠先生…一起上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "253483bb144a8757311798001642a9fea33adddced3221b1a3e52ebfc1b49dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208494a47f6a77054100c594",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好美的月亮……呀！？\r\n那个、那个……嘎哦！……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c170b582ad4b4d8ebc28e858e4855026c84e759593ff49be32185010e7fdc3e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe61e59d0da0083fd4be44e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应援？……欸嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d52685385230a78b2ad0f722660bdc8e011cb8eb039d679f24b68ea846c2f900",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12797e7cb03060e8b0f2d00f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——！要变得幸福、呼诶！？\r\n啊……呵呵♪……嗯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec6e7ca42e34c37b790c4ee41f1b57b16973c5ea2d37abd52a4cb2473a5cff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2db62d5d6cd5a751056b6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能来听听，米浴唱歌吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3045917b8cab599c9e41eb29b4de2a92e434b68784008c0938eed0b5875c0e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b40d2743862f226a5c1654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，能高兴就好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4187f578181acb49b0d7a2f2b903e8dd17b572c89644835c6a31eda9517a85d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb98eba895fe6d83ebfae808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴的表现…看好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "894aa9c4f770dbcf9e1130010b016230acac322b5f69cd52b17714cbfff0bf06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6d6b67bde07477cd8ef7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起那个时候，\n米浴有所成长了吗？\n…如果有的话，我很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f673026ec38052995ef5be7b5e105a5ac4dcdcf35a359cdea1a08d186597ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6697a4c68660f4b96d9d46c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，合适吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbfcc1619b3cb23a738bff1068ffaf14855ec8aae28f3043e582c3fd89602af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b80d6b7d64b4f250eeacb7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇啊…轻飘飘的～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820631a615584e401767facdc772aaeab9b17276ca91b0e6941269651145eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377eecf5d839766a56968380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像蔷薇花一样…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b17b229e6e3a2657610ea01851b3083623b54ecd44756ad8eeef16c01357ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c3ad88771c1db7c8b87742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来到这里真是太好了…\n因为遇见了重要的人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e5d807293718437861029f55d8875fc08d4afb172c4f0d7325e10193bd256d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d859c68ab70cf0f250467b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被这样盯着看的话…好害羞啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20857c6de226ab55db50a65520f727bf5e4d99ddbc3251e8fc0dae498163962f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921089d4c665927ad3cf25e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也一定…很耀眼吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6d91df76994e33aec5441733f76fcb35ea2531d266be092e9f5446e6fe0784",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f194423a5d9f85a73bc9f1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好了，吸血鬼米浴……来了哦。\r\n……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd53ec212e1784fbe61064262a5886bceebe2bf245b15d28d7e140ca8c51733b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70016"
      ]
    }
  ]
